msgstr "Päivitetään"

#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeController.py:2460
msgid "Upgrade infeasible"
msgstr "Päivitys on toteuttamiskelvoton"

#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeController.py:2461
