msgstr "Päivitys on puutteellinen"

#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeController.py:2485
#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeController.py:2501
msgid ""
"The upgrade has partially completed but there were errors during the upgrade "
